{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is near, move to grab position. Else, scan the area. Finally, grab, check properties and process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToGrabPosition    /> <Condition ID = isObjectNearby    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
